From b5ef9375ecba387b3abb1b428c2419c5070e1220 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaptainPhantasy <DouglasTalley1977@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2026 00:28:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] fix: replace todo reminder auto-continue heuristic with
 progress-based check

- Remove text-parsing #isYieldedToUser heuristic (unreliable, non-deterministic)
- Add #lastCompletedTodoCount: auto-continue only when agent completed tasks
  since last check; notification-only when no progress (agent yielding or stuck)
- Make eager-todo conditional: classify request type before forcing todo_write;
  advisory/conversational requests skip todos, implementation requests create them
- Remove toolChoice force from #createEagerTodoPrelude
- Add yielded field to todo_reminder event across extension/hook/custom-tool types
- Reset progress counter on new prompt, new session, and handoff
